  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_DAMAGE has the value 51</p>
  <p>Sets the damage amount and damage type delivered by a prim on collision.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
